  "text": "About Hope Veterinary Oncology Services | Vet In Lacey, WA 98516\n253-341-5835\ninfo@hopeoncology.vet\nInstagram\nInstagram\nHome\nAbout\nOur Philosophy\nChoose Hope\nOur Team\nThe Hope Mobile\nReviews\nServices\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Pet Owners\nRemote Consulting\nResources\nAfter Care\nAmputees\nFinancial Assistance\nVeterinary Health Care Workers\nPatient Direct by Standard Process\nQuality-of-Life Assessment\nArticles & News\nYouTube Library\nVideos\nRequest A Consult\nSelect Page\nHOPE VETERINARY ONCOLOGY SERVICES IS PROUD TO BE AN INDEPENDENT PRACTICE.\nOur Philosophy\nWe believe that treating a patient is not just a matter of addressing their medical needs. Patients with cancer\nneed more than cancer treatment. At HVOS, we attempt to address needs such as nutritional support, immune support, mobility issues, and emotional support for the family unit.\nAbout Hope Veterinary Oncology Services\nWe also believe that pet parents need more than medical options and a financial estimate. Finding out that your loved one has been diagnosed with cancer is tough to hear. All sorts of emotions and concerns surface. We promise to deliver news compassionately and honestly. We will answer all your questions as many times as you need to ask them. Additionally, if your pet requires more emotional support or guidance, we work closely with a local social worker to help.\nWe firmly believe that the health of any business is deeply entrenched in the well-being of its team. We consider it a privilege to be able to contribute to our team’s well-being by paying well above industry standards, respecting and encouraging time off, acknowledging the emotional challenges of caregiving, and offering financial assistance for mental health support if not covered by health insurance.\n\nMailing Address\n1420 Marvin Road NE\nSuite C #316\nLacey, WA 98516\n\nContact Information\nP:\n253-341-5835\nF:\n253-257-1854\nE:\ninfo@hopeoncology.vet\n\nHours\nSunday:\n9am-3pm\nMonday:\n8am-5pm\nTuesday:\n8am-5pm\nWednesday:\n9am-3pm\nThursday:\n8am-5pm\nFriday:\nClosed\nSaturday:\nClosed\n© 2024 Hope Veterinary Oncology Services |\nPrivacy Policy\n|",
